# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
# Cargo.lock is intentionally COMMITTED: without it, every build re-resolves
# against live crates.io, and an upstream yank (algonaut_client 0.4.x,
# 2026-06) made the whole workspace unbuildable. See docs/ASSUMPTIONS_REVIEW.md.
# Fuzz crates keep their own lockfiles ignored below.
crates/*/fuzz/Cargo.lock

